<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>Getting Things Done with Engine Yard</title>
  
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag    "application", :media => "all" %>
  <%= javascript_include_tag "application" %>
  <%# jQuery UI (tabs) comes from the official jQuery CDN instead of a
      vendored copy in the tree.

      Pinned to 1.13.2, the final 1.x release. The previous pin (1.8.13, 2012)
      is affected by four published XSS issues -- CVE-2015-9251, CVE-2016-7961,
      CVE-2020-11022 and CVE-2020-11023 -- all fixed in 1.12.0/1.12.1. The
      .tabs() API used below is unchanged between those versions.

      Served from code.jquery.com (upstream project) rather than a Google-hosted
      copy. crossorigin/referrerpolicy are set; a subresource-integrity hash can
      be added with:
        curl -sL <url> | openssl dgst -sha384 -binary | openssl base64 -A
      which must be recomputed on every version bump. %>
  <script src="https://code.jquery.com/ui/1.13.2/jquery-ui.min.js"
          crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></script>
  <%= csrf_meta_tags %>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="all">
        <div id="header">
            <h1><span class="intro">Getting Things Done</span> deployed on <span class="branding">Engine Yard</span></h1>
            <p class="sample">Sample Deployment Application</p>
        </div>
        <div id="content">
            <% if alerted = alert %>
                <p id="alert"><%= alerted %></p>
            <% end %>
            <%= yield %>
        </div>
		<div id="foot">
      <div class="logo">
        <a href="http://www.engineyard.com"><img src="/images/ey-wordmark.png"></a>
      </div>
			<div class="copyright">
			<p>
			  Running on <a href="http://www.engineyard.com">Engine Yard</a> and <a href="http://www.rubyonrails.org">Rails</a><br>
			  Ruby is the Language of the Cloud.<br>
			  Copyright © Engine Yard, Inc. All rights reserved.
			</p>
			</div>
		</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
